Package: eiDPM
Type: Package
Title: Dirichlet-Process Mixture Models for 2x2 Ecological Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Weaver", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "weaver.michaeld@gmail.com")
Description: Parametric and nonparametric (truncated Dirichlet-process mixture)
    Bayesian models for 2x2 ecological inference in the incomplete-data framework of
    Imai, Lu and Strauss (2008) <doi:10.1093/pan/mpm017>, under no contextual effects
    (CAR) or a joint model of rates and composition (NCAR). Two samplers are provided:
    a blocked Gibbs sampler in C++ and Hamiltonian Monte Carlo through 'rstan'.
